/*!
\page page_sttracktopologymap StTrackTopologyMap

\brief Compact bit-field encoding which detector layers a reconstructed track has hits in.

\section sttracktopologymap_overview Overview

\ref StTrackTopologyMap encodes the detector-layer hit pattern of a reconstructed
track in two 32-bit words (\c mMap0, \c mMap1) covering 64 bits, plus a supplementary
64-bit word (\c mMap_iTpc) for the inner TPC (iTPC) upgrade (Run 18+).

The map enables O(1) sub-detector membership queries without iterating over hit
collections, making it ideal for fast track-selection cuts in analysis code.

\section sttracktopologymap_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
StObject
  └── StTrackTopologyMap
\endcode

\section sttracktopologymap_bitlayout Bit Layout Summary

| Bits | Case 1 (TPC/SVT) | Case 2 (FTPC) | Case 3 (HFT) |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Primary vertex used | ← | ← |
| 1–7 | SVT layers 1–6 + SSD | FTPC-W rows 1–7 | PXL/IST/SSD layers |
| 8–20 | TPC rows 1–13 | FTPC rows 7–20 | TPC rows 1–13 |
| 21–52 | TPC rows 14–45 | — | TPC rows 14–45 |
| 53–58 | MWPC, CTB, TOF, RICH, BEMC, EEMC | ← | ← |
| 59–63 | Post-X, membrane-X, HFT flag, turn-around, FTPC flag | ← | ← |

\c mMap_iTpc encodes iTPC rows 1–40 using the same row-bit scheme.

\section sttracktopologymap_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| \c mMap0 | \c UInt_t | Bits 0–31 (SVT/PXL/IST/SSD, TPC rows 1–24). |
| \c mMap1 | \c UInt_t | Bits 32–63 (TPC rows 25–45, fast detectors, flags). |
| \c mMap_iTpc | \c ULong64_t | iTPC hit-row pattern (Run 18+). |

\section sttracktopologymap_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StTrackTopologyMap& topo = track->topologyMap();

// Require >= 15 TPC hits
if (topo.numberOfHits(kTpcId) < 15) return;

// TPC-only track
if (!topo.trackTpcOnly()) return;

// BEMC match
if (topo.hasHitInBemc()) { /* extrapolate to calorimeter */ }

// Largest gap
int gap = topo.largestGap(kTpcId);
\endcode

\see StTrack
*/
